 wolf type breeds  were of middle status like garaxis even  though he was deformed and melees who  was old but yet had a body size that was  only a bit bigger than drogon the  smallest were the horse type breeds like  Cyrax and Sunfire they are more Nimble  in the air but size wise they were  nowhere close to the other breeds Cyrax  should have grown exponentially during  the time jumps but stayed almost the  same if not a tiny bit bigger  number four blood magic it is stated  that dragons are believed to be  intrinsically tied to Magic in the world  since the death of The Last Dragon  Summers grew shorter and Winter's colder  while magical spells became less  powerful when Danny's dragons were born  magic return and this was kind of a  feedback loop as the Resurgence of magic  initiated in the blood and fire ritual  also probably accelerated the growth  rate of the Three Dragons Dem growing to  a full size in seven years as compared  to a young juvenile sized air acts of  six years old as undeniably a fact that  blood magic was the cause of their large  sizes at a young age drogon at 8 years  old was nearly as big as melees who was  more than 80 years old  number five ambient magic we know that  Valerian was the only Targaryen Dragon  alive at the time of the conquest who  was born before the Doom of valyria and  his birth in a more magical place and  time may have contributed to his huge  size it was evident that valerians were  powerful magic users and their specialty  in Fire magic was unmatched so they also  probably use it to manipulate Dragon  sights and growth rate at the height of  the Valyrian Freehold their Peninsula  aided by the 14 fires created an ambient  environment of Fire magic like a  surround sound system therefore the  pre-doom era Valeria would have produced  larger dragons than Westeros where there  was no magic at all  number six individuality this is also a  good Factor there is also the case of  individual dragons having their specific  genes to be bigger or smaller the prime  example is drogon he is said to be the  living Reincarnation of valerian the  black dread and so he possessed the  innate criteria within him to be big and  grow faster than his other siblings  when they hatch out from their eggs it  was clearly stated that drogon was  already slightly bigger than the other  two who were rhaegar and viserion even  after accounting to the fact that all  three Dragons Were hatched at the same  time with the same Fire and Blood Magic  Ritual  and number seven the generation factor  of all the Targaryen dragons that we  know Valerian lived to be around 200  years of age and was the largest by the  time of the dance of the Dragons vegar  was approaching the size of the black  dread even though she was born in  Dragonstone 52 years before the conquest  but a strange thing is that these  dragons that were born in Westeros  always became smaller in size every  successive generation the second  generation dragons like Verma Thor dream  fire and Silverwing were way smaller  than vegar the third generation which  were caraxis and melees were of middle  size the first generation dragons like  Cyrax were even smaller this went on and  on to the loss of the Targaryen dragons  grew to be the size of a small dog  and that's where we will end with the  seven factors of dragon growth  so I hope you have enjoyed watching this  video do hit the like button for support  and subscribe but most of all smash that  Bell icon for regular updates on new  videos right here on this channel till  next time take care fam

